**Assumptions:**

*   Current environmental conditions: High pollen levels, elevated temperatures.
*   Resource Status: Mobile Information Unit and Medical Team are on standby.
*   Triggers for Deployment: Significant increase in pollen levels, temperature spike, reported health incidents, or public requests for assistance.
*   Traffic conditions: Assume moderate traffic conditions. Real-time traffic data will be used upon actual dispatch.
*   Road closures: No current road closures reported. Real-time monitoring will be conducted upon dispatch.

